{"_id":"A1us8vAxAS071Mfz","img":"modules/pf2e-dungeon-crawl/assets/creature-art/pathfinder-bestiary-2/specter.webp","items":[{"_id":"zjVbARImBBAx6EKv","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","name":"Vile Touch","sort":100000,"system":{"attack":{"value":""},"attackEffects":{"custom":"","value":[]},"bonus":{"value":16},"damageRolls":{"0":{"damage":"2d8+8","damageType":"void"}},"description":{"value":""},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"range":null,"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["finesse"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"melee","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!A1us8vAxAS071Mfz.zjVbARImBBAx6EKv"},{"_id":"V9Ei1dwq0RUilrjT","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.kdhbPaBMK1d1fpbA"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Telepathy 100 feet (With Spectral Thralls Only)","sort":200000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"interaction","description":{"value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.Telepathy]</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary"},"rules":[],"slug":"telepathy","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["aura","magical"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!A1us8vAxAS071Mfz.V9Ei1dwq0RUilrjT"},{"_id":"9wolaUuOroFk0cOg","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.etMnv73EIdEZrYYu"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Frightful Presence","sort":300000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>30 feet. @Check[will|dc:22|options:area-effect,inflicts:frightened]</p>\n<hr />\n<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.FrightfulPresence]</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary"},"rules":[{"key":"Aura","radius":30,"slug":"frightful-presence","traits":["emotion","fear","mental"]}],"slug":"frightful-presence","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["aura","emotion","fear","mental"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!A1us8vAxAS071Mfz.9wolaUuOroFk0cOg"},{"_id":"RGaUdIjwMpgnNYGg","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Pain Starvation","sort":400000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>A specter that goes for more than a month without dealing void damage to a living humanoid becomes desperate and almost feral. It changes alignment from lawful evil to chaotic evil, loses control of any corrupted thralls it might have, and becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.nlCjDvLMf2EkV2dl]{Quickened}. It can use its additional action only to make vile touch Strikes against humanoid targets. At the end of any turn in which it deals any amount of void damage to a living humanoid, it reverts to lawful evil and is no longer quickened, but any thralls it lost control of remain free.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!A1us8vAxAS071Mfz.RGaUdIjwMpgnNYGg"},{"_id":"qh8LFXVLWjILfZZx","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Sunlight Powerlessness","sort":500000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>A specter caught in sunlight is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.i3OJZU2nk64Df3xm]{Clumsy 2} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 2} for as long as it remains in the sunlight.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!A1us8vAxAS071Mfz.qh8LFXVLWjILfZZx"},{"_id":"wtvDPCazUVSsqJ2O","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.TTCw5NusiSSkJU1x"},"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Void Healing","sort":600000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.NegativeHealing]</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary 2"},"rules":[{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"override","path":"system.attributes.hp.negativeHealing","value":true}],"slug":"negative-healing","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!A1us8vAxAS071Mfz.wtvDPCazUVSsqJ2O"},{"_id":"OSiq1CXChzTT7udW","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/TwoActions.webp","name":"Spectral Corruption","sort":700000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"action"},"actions":{"value":2},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>The specter makes a Vile Touch Strike. If it damages a living creature, the specter gains [[/r 5 #Temporary Hit Points]]{5 temporary Hit Points} and the target creature must attempt a @Check[will|dc:24] save to avoid becoming corrupted.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected and is temporarily immune to spectral corruption for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 2} for 1 hour.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature succumbs to the corruption and becomes a spectral thrall temporarily. The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.9qGBRpbX9NEwtAAr]{Controlled} by the specter, obeying the specter's telepathic or spoken orders, though a spectral thrall does not obey obviously self-destructive orders. This lasts until the end of the thrall's next turn, at which point it is no longer controlled but becomes stupefied 2 for 1 hour.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the duration is unlimited. The thrall can attempt a new Will save at the end of each of its turns; on a success, it is no longer controlled by the specter but becomes stupefied 2 for 1 hour.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["curse","divine","incapacitation","mental"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!A1us8vAxAS071Mfz.OSiq1CXChzTT7udW"}],"name":"Specter","system":{"abilities":{"cha":{"mod":4},"con":{"mod":4},"dex":{"mod":6},"int":{"mod":0},"str":{"mod":-5},"wis":{"mod":4}},"attributes":{"ac":{"details":"","value":25},"allSaves":{"value":""},"hp":{"details":"void healing","max":95,"temp":0,"value":95},"immunities":[{"type":"bleed"},{"type":"death-effects"},{"type":"disease"},{"type":"paralyzed"},{"type":"poison"},{"type":"precision"},{"type":"unconscious"}],"resistances":[{"doubleVs":["non-magical"],"exceptions":["force","ghost-touch","vitality"],"type":"all-damage","value":5}],"speed":{"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"fly","value":40}],"value":0}},"details":{"blurb":"","languages":{"details":"telepathy 100 feet (with spectral thralls only)","value":["common","necril"]},"level":{"value":7},"privateNotes":"","publicNotes":"<p>When an evil mortal creature dies, it sometimes returns to haunt the area of its death as a specter, a hateful remnant, always seeking to slay others-particularly humanoids-in an attempt to distribute its pain among as many souls as it can. A specter maintains a strange semblance of its prior identity, but with a corrupted sense of purpose. It cannot be reasoned with.</p>\n<p>A specter denied the opportunity to harm living humanoids grows increasingly agonized and irrational, akin to the mindset of a starving person forever denied a release from agony through death.</p>","publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary 2"}},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"perception":{"details":"","mod":15,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"}]},"resources":{},"saves":{"fortitude":{"saveDetail":"","value":13},"reflex":{"saveDetail":"","value":17},"will":{"saveDetail":"","value":15}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"base":17},"intimidation":{"base":15},"stealth":{"base":17}},"traits":{"rarity":"common","size":{"value":"med"},"value":["evil","incorporeal","lawful","undead","unholy"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"npc","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.pathfinder-bestiary-2.Actor.HNEUSYnInffvGPHK"},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors!A1us8vAxAS071Mfz","folder":null,"prototypeToken":{"texture":{"src":"modules/pf2e-dungeon-crawl/assets/creature-art/pathfinder-bestiary-2/specter.webp"}},"flags":{"pf2e-dungeon-crawl":{"artEntryId":"pathfinder_bestiary_2__specter","sourcePack":"pf2e.pathfinder-bestiary-2","sourceDocId":"HNEUSYnInffvGPHK"}}}